{"version":1,"key":"article:30","content":{"id":30,"title":"Tauri 踩坑与技巧","author":"","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"efcf9b7f-5d89-4b05-8344-95a0b53851fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Drag And Drop"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aec92cbb-a4ad-445c-92e4-9a2d545b3f85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Tauri 默认不支持 H5 Drag And Drop API，需要在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tauri.config.json"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中禁止 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fileDropEnabled"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，二者不能同时工作。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"json","uuid":"0c091e29-42d6-4536-9333-baf5b83d2f6f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a4acb2b7-17a0-4fcd-a08e-fb3b54be7229","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  // ...\n  \"tauri\": {\n    // ...\n    \"windows\": [{\n        \"fileDropEnabled\": false\n    }]\n  }\n}","collabId":"f9c1cd59-6c55-4621-adb8-baf96b706d04","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"42ba32b8-7b06-46ba-9687-8eacf3f9d2f6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"131a4faa-44f8-4edf-b9b2-65309d1be4ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我还以为我的用法不对，浪费我好多时间，淦。"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"3a7e9f84-714a-4b0e-8c3f-b0d9147f5aa8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自动更新"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"92d374d4-460d-444d-88ef-3b446ec20b0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Tauri 自动更新需要在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tauri.updater"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dialog"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"checkUpdate"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时一直在等待状态"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"json","uuid":"c16a2637-d6f5-4e40-97e6-3e0749a30e37","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0a026310-48bd-465f-9ee4-2f4fd6801c9a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"tauri\": {\n    \"updater\": {\n      \"dialog\": false\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"bc0d9fcf-c23c-4e6f-8520-15f134c0c068","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"37df1fd5-e2f3-4e7f-8f39-8da71dabe9c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"窗口圆角"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f6595f4-1ece-4d2d-aca0-1c843f71c694","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Tauri 目前不能通过配置实现这个功能，因此要实现圆角一定不能使用自带的 titlebar，需要在页面中实现，首先干掉自带的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"titlebar"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且将窗口设置为透明"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"json","uuid":"5bf8082c-799a-4291-bcce-d66acf13f736","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"26aa4e8f-0edd-4bef-b5a6-360117085a2b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"tauri\": {\n    \"windows\": [{\n      \"decorations\": false,\n      \"transparent\": true\n    }]\n  }\n}","collabId":"f09ff248-2824-41fb-a3a3-e4db2089282a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8802283-e349-4206-8e39-d471166b458b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后在页面的根元素设置圆角"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"d73c32ac-f0cd-4763-bbc0-1c7225faf6c6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d22db812-2d58-4db5-a6b1-c3e0122ec61c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"#root {\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  /* 要设置背景色，否则整个窗口都是透明的 */\n  background: var(--primary-bg-color);\n}\n\n/* 最大化的时候不使用圆角 */\n#root.maximized {\n  border-radius: 0;\n}","collabId":"09b45e32-5e73-4446-a833-fcda8bc1432a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0c23fc04-9441-45db-bda6-5b3b8967da6b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"窗口阴影"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c445e5f-1056-42b3-b839-6bea5cec81ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用插件 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/window-shadows","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"352c490e-7023-4e85-a53e-6a94856f19f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"windows-shadows"}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"toml","uuid":"8a9baeb9-d62e-4dad-9be4-f1984fd36498","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"41a9e34f-05f6-40dd-b19d-4bd216c5e193","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"[dependencies]\nwindow-shadows = \"0.2.2\"","collabId":"d2fe2621-e12e-4d03-9ce9-fd2d39f7a6a3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rust","uuid":"3493a6e5-c501-49a7-b496-40900e717031","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"895724f0-a962-46b6-b2c4-ad6cf0f2d9b2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"use window_shadows::set_shadow;\n\nfn main() {\n  // ...\n  tauri::Builder::default()\n  \t.setup(|app|) {\n      // ...\n      let window = app.get_window(\"main\").unwrap();\n      set_shadow(&window, true).expect(\"Unsupported platform!\");\n  }\n}","collabId":"f9cf9339-9f47-433c-86ba-d6b86b987629","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"注意","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"d90c8b28-745b-4dcd-9814-95286e94a5e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"836296a6-e698-45b4-85d0-87a170fb3a8d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tauri@v2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，已经原生支持开启和关闭阴影了。"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"40cada1f-55ce-4d6f-9777-3fca4fbe7db9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"引用本地文件"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0217d1df-84d9-4df1-979a-090a13a6ac77","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Tauri 中要引用本地文件，需要使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"convertFileSrc"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将本地路径转化为特殊的 HTTP 路径，需要先 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tauri.conf.json"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件中设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"asset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 协议"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"json","uuid":"bc6a9603-b73e-4efb-aa2c-baac0c099e9f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4e790147-e5b5-48ae-af07-90130c3b981d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"tauri\": {\n    \"allowlist\": {\n      \"protocol\": {\n        \"asset\": true,\n        \"assetScope\": [\n          \"**\"\n        ]\n      },\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"e02e5484-8b8a-43a6-88df-7d2982b03e68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"ts","uuid":"7d80dae0-bbc8-4d57-b595-471b6c582bd1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"eadcea34-dfc1-4d41-9e8b-6c11a0396d2f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import { convertFileSrc } from \"@tauri-apps/api/tauri\";\n\n// -> https://asset.localhost/C%3A%5CUsers%5Cpc%5C.editor%5Cresources%5Cimage_87146a94-78a7-40ce-a9ea-23710c9e3f56.png\nconvertFileSrc('C:\\\\Users\\\\pc\\\\.editor\\\\resources\\image_87146a94-78a7-40ce-a9ea-23710c9e3f56.png ')","collabId":"8c9d4385-b644-41a7-b7df-8555a510c8a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a1357856-acc2-4c85-b1a2-dbe3272c14cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"vite-plugin-wasm"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35362fa2-cb9b-46c7-a2fe-89ca5804ecb8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我使用了 tinypng-lib 这个库来对图片进行压缩，该包使用 wasm，需要使用 vite-plugin-wasm 进行处理，按照"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/vite-plugin-wasm","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"3191db70-04a6-4a72-b0b9-52daf11db6bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文档"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"进行了安装和使用"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Bash","uuid":"65f88d0d-bb42-44f8-bd1f-2e2c829b5cc2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"df871ed3-f0a3-426d-93f2-5a75eddabb55","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"pnpm add vite-plugin-wasm vite-plugin-top-level-await","collabId":"106ef5f7-f2bd-48ee-8d1f-fd80ec3a15d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"d0c9c769-d7dd-4054-aff4-6b0a145a9f28","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3b09cdf4-484b-4878-a76a-9dc78a734835","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import wasm from \"vite-plugin-wasm\";\nimport topLevelAwait from \"vite-plugin-top-level-await\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    wasm(),\n    topLevelAwait()\n  ]\n})","collabId":"87d5fe9b-a312-490e-8423-9d9d29a07cf6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8aba3f0a-43e7-4583-8f8d-66cbf9beec45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在开发模式下是没有问题，但是打包构建后就没法打开软件，现在还不知道什么原因，不想折腾了。"}]}],"tags":["Tauri","踩坑"],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-57ljm8_32c328ab-6190-4a2b-bab1-7b17aadc1d32.jpg","createTime":1700984011085,"updateTime":1775869698643},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1775869698643}}